# Canonical triage record for AD18-RSH-002
# Root cause: Same as AD18-RSH-001 (crates/atm-core/src/home.rs line 18-19)
# Issue: ATM_HOME environment variable has no length or UTF-8 validation bounds
# Severity: Important (input-limits hardening tier)
# Repeatable: false (specific validation gap, not pattern-based)

